    "detailed_description": "Potato Salad is a collection of 7 games across different genres. Each game covers a potato from a different time period and highlights the never ending battle against The King of Spud Town who is always scheming to get his way.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>- 7 unique games across different genres.<br>- Obtain extras from completing challenges.<br>- Remastered and formatted to HD resolution.<br>- Designed with the Steam Deck in mind.<br>- Play the games in any order you wish!<br><br><strong>THE LEGENDARY POTATOES</strong><br>Below you will find information on the potatoes and types of games contained within this collection:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/ebfcddf7eb7b918cffe1a8d33ebea0d2.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Inspector Smith<br>GENRE: Point and Click<br>This potato has always found an explanation to every mystery possible. Until now! At the cost of his sanity, he attempts to solve the case of the missing television.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/c04cc3ad1d8cc28733d1aed540e07949.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Potatoman<br>GENRE: Platformer<br>An ordinary potato has his life upended when he is magically transported to a new dimension. In this universe, he is the Potatoman and must save the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/7d81b14d49b729881dba3008f61d0805.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Beat Hiratio<br>GENRE: Beat em' Up<br>The only justice this potato knows is at the end of his fists. Asked to provide food in exchange for monies, he agrees to make the biggest feast in history.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/44d36855c041cadffab429669828b051.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Boxer Yakuzomo<br>GENRE: Boxing<br>A potato determined to become the strongest punchmaster in all the lands. Win all the belts and claim the championship once and for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/bfa2b76933ecd4288918717d41f006e5.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Spaceace Alexius<br>GENRE: Shooter<br>The legendary spaceace is contracted to obtain an item of great power. The grizzled veteran sets off for one last trip; sure to be the deadliest yet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/422628f8f9400b3485a481f7ae56d280.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Chaos Vasquez<br>GENRE: Action<br>Wandering the wasteland without a cause, a hapless king approaches him with a proposal he can't refuse. Everything he's ever known is about to be tested...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/ece4a30294e4f82c1f6572fd92e87afb.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>8Bit Potato<br>GENRE: Arcade Minigame Collection<br>Trapped in an arcade machine, 8bit potato must beat the high scores to become the ultimate gamer.",
