img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/44d36855c041cadffab429669828b051.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Boxer Yakuzomo<br>GENRE: Boxing<br>A potato determined to become the strongest punchmaster in all the lands. Win all the belts and claim the championship once and for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/bfa2b76933ecd4288918717d41f006e5.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Spaceace Alexius<br>GENRE: Shooter<br>The legendary spaceace is contracted to obtain an item of great power. The grizzled veteran sets off for one last trip; sure to be the deadliest yet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/422628f8f9400b3485a481f7ae56d280.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>Chaos Vasquez<br>GENRE: Action<br>Wandering the wasteland without a cause, a hapless king approaches him with a proposal he can't refuse. Everything he's ever known is about to be tested...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855740/extras/ece4a30294e4f82c1f6572fd92e87afb.avif?t=1710591807\" width=177 height=169 /></span><br>8Bit Potato<br>GENRE: Arcade Minigame Collection<br>Trapped in an arcade machine, 8bit potato must beat the high scores to become the ultimate gamer.",
